## My Recommended Primary Model

> **Claude Sonnet 5 — My Daily Driver**

As a heavy professional user spanning research, coding, strategy, and career prep, Sonnet 5 gives the best balance of intelligence, speed, and versatility. It handles 85–90% of tasks exceptionally well without the latency cost of Opus or the limitations of Haiku.

