## Model Guide

### 🔵 Haiku 4.5 — Fast & Lightweight
Use for:
- Quick grammar/spell checks on resume drafts
- Simple Q&A and fast fact lookups
- Reformatting or bullet-pointing content
- Generating quick cover letter outlines
- Fixing minor code bugs (<10 lines)
- Daily task lists

### 🟣 Sonnet 5 — Balanced & Versatile (Primary)
Use for:
- Writing and polishing full resumes & cover letters
- Research summaries and literature reviews
- Business plan drafts and market analysis
- Interview prep and mock Q&A sessions
- Coding projects, debugging, and explanations
- Career strategy and job search planning
- Learning new concepts deeply

### 🔴 Opus 5 — Powerful & Strategic
Use for:
- Full business plan with competitive analysis
- Complex multi-system architecture design
- Deep industry research with synthesis
- Critical resume for senior/executive roles
- Solving hard algorithmic coding problems
- Strategic career pivots requiring deep reasoning
- When Sonnet gives unsatisfying output

