## Final Recommendation

> **If I could only use ONE model and ONE effort level:**
>
> ### ✅ Claude Sonnet 5 + Standard Effort
>
> For a professional heavy user spanning research, resume building, career prep, coding, and business strategy — Sonnet 5 at Standard effort is the sweet spot. It handles 90% of tasks with high quality, is fast enough not to break workflow, and flexible enough to scale up to High effort or Opus for truly critical moments.
>
> Upgrade to **Opus 5 + Max** only when the output will be seen by an employer, investor, or client — or when a decision significantly impacts career or business.

